<!-- ATTACK PATH                                                          -->
<!-- ================================================================== -->
<section class="section section--stone" aria-labelledby="s4-title">
  <div class="container">
    <header class="shead">
      <div class="shead__meta"></div>
      <div class="shead__body">
        <h2 class="shead__title rv" id="s4-title">How Attackers Exploit Network Weaknesses and How We Test Them</h2>
        <p class="shead__lede rv" style="--d:1">Network attacks often involve multiple stages, from finding exposed systems to exploiting vulnerabilities and attempting to access sensitive information. Our Network Security Testing Services simulate these attack paths in an authorized environment to identify security gaps and help businesses understand how attackers could compromise their network infrastructure.</p>
      </div>
    </header>

    <div class="triggers">
      <div class="trigger rv">
        <span class="trigger__ico">{{ icon("eye", "lg") }}</span>
        <h3 class="trigger__title">External Network Exposure</h3>
        <div class="trigger__text">
          <p>Attackers often begin by scanning internet-facing systems to identify open ports and exposed services. We assess your external network to uncover misconfigured services and outdated systems along with weaknesses that could provide an entry point into your infrastructure.</p>
          <p class="trigger__why"><strong>How We Test It:</strong> We conduct network scans and service discovery along with targeted vulnerability checks to identify exposed assets and validate potential security risks.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="trigger rv">
        <span class="trigger__ico">{{ icon("terminal", "lg") }}</span>
        <h3 class="trigger__title">Service Exploitation and Initial Access</h3>
        <div class="trigger__text">
          <p>Once a weakness is identified, attackers may attempt to exploit vulnerable services or use weak credentials to gain access. Our testing evaluates how these weaknesses could affect network security and whether existing controls can prevent unauthorized entry.</p>
          <p class="trigger__why"><strong>How We Test It:</strong> We perform controlled exploitation attempts and credential security checks within the approved scope to validate vulnerabilities and assess their potential impact.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="trigger rv">
        <span class="trigger__ico">{{ icon("escalate", "lg") }}</span>
        <h3 class="trigger__title">Privilege Escalation and Unauthorized Access</h3>
        <div class="trigger__text">
          <p>After gaining initial access, attackers may try to obtain higher permissions to reach restricted systems or sensitive business resources. We examine access controls and system configurations to identify weaknesses that could allow unauthorized privilege escalation.</p>
          <p class="trigger__why"><strong>How We Test It:</strong> We assess permissions and configuration weaknesses to determine if access can be expanded beyond the intended level.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="trigger rv">
        <span class="trigger__ico">{{ icon("lateral", "lg") }}</span>
        <h3 class="trigger__title">Lateral Movement Across the Network</h3>
        <div class="trigger__text">
          <p>Attackers who compromise one system may attempt to access other connected devices and critical servers. Weak network segmentation and excessive permissions can make this movement easier and increase the impact of an attack.</p>
          <p class="trigger__why"><strong>How We Test It:</strong> We evaluate network segmentation and access restrictions to identify paths that could allow unauthorized movement between systems.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="trigger rv">
        <span class="trigger__ico">{{ icon("database", "lg") }}</span>
        <h3 class="trigger__title">Sensitive Data and Critical System Access</h3>
        <div class="trigger__text">
          <p>Attackers may target business databases and file servers along with administrative systems to obtain confidential information or disrupt operations. Our assessment identifies weaknesses that could expose these resources to unauthorized access.</p>
          <p class="trigger__why"><strong>How We Test It:</strong> We verify access controls and examine relevant security configurations to determine if sensitive systems and data are adequately protected.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="trigger rv">
        <span class="trigger__ico">{{ icon("doc-check", "lg") }}</span>
        <h3 class="trigger__title">Security Findings and Remediation</h3>
        <p class="trigger__text">Following testing, we document validated vulnerabilities and explain their potential business impact. Our findings include risk-based priorities and practical recommendations to help IT teams address security gaps and improve network protection.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

