<!-- PROCESS                                                              -->
<!-- ================================================================== -->
<section class="section section--ink" aria-labelledby="s5-title">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="process">
      <div class="process__aside">
        <h2 class="process__title" id="s5-title">How Our Network Security Testing Services Process Works</h2>
        <p class="process__lede">CipherTrivia follows a structured Network Security Testing Services process to identify security gaps and help businesses protect their IT infrastructure from cyber threats. From reviewing network access to verifying security weaknesses, our approach focuses on identifying risks and providing practical recommendations that help organizations improve network protection.</p>
      </div>

      <ol class="process__list" data-process>
        <li class="step">
          <span class="step__marker" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <h3 class="step__title">Network Assessment and Scope Definition</h3>
          <p class="step__text">We begin by understanding your network environment and identifying the systems and devices included in the assessment. This helps us focus on critical business assets and determine which areas require closer security checks.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="step">
          <span class="step__marker" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <h3 class="step__title">Security Weakness Identification</h3>
          <p class="step__text">Our team examines network devices and security settings to identify weaknesses that could expose systems to unauthorized access. This includes reviewing firewall rules and access permissions along with exposed services and outdated configurations.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="step">
          <span class="step__marker" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <h3 class="step__title">Vulnerability Validation and Risk Analysis</h3>
          <p class="step__text">Identified weaknesses are reviewed to understand their severity and potential impact on business operations. Where authorized, we conduct controlled tests to determine how these issues could affect network security and prioritize the risks that need immediate attention.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="step">
          <span class="step__marker" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <h3 class="step__title">Network Security Testing Report</h3>
          <p class="step__text">We prepare a clear report outlining the identified vulnerabilities and explaining their potential consequences. Each finding includes risk-based prioritization and practical recommendations to help your IT team understand what needs to be addressed.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="step">
          <span class="step__marker" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <h3 class="step__title">Remediation Recommendations</h3>
          <p class="step__text">Our recommendations focus on helping your team resolve security gaps through improved configurations and stronger access controls along with appropriate updates and network protection measures.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="step">
          <span class="step__marker" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <h3 class="step__title">Retesting and Security Verification</h3>
          <p class="step__text">After corrective actions are implemented, retesting can verify whether the reported weaknesses have been addressed. This helps confirm the effectiveness of security improvements and highlights any remaining issues that require attention.</p>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

