      <ol class="deliver__list">
        <li class="deliver__item rv">
          {{ icon("present") }}
          <div>
            <h3 class="deliver__title">Executive Summary</h3>
            <p class="deliver__text">Receive a clear overview of your network security status with key findings and potential business risks. This summary helps decision-makers understand the most important security concerns without requiring deep technical knowledge.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="deliver__item rv">
          {{ icon("document") }}
          <div>
            <h3 class="deliver__title">Detailed Vulnerability Assessment Report</h3>
            <p class="deliver__text">Our report documents identified network vulnerabilities and explains how they could affect your systems. Findings include affected assets and severity ratings along with relevant evidence to help your IT team investigate each issue.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="deliver__item rv">
          {{ icon("alert") }}
          <div>
            <h3 class="deliver__title">Risk Classification and Prioritization</h3>
            <p class="deliver__text">Each finding is categorized according to its severity and potential business impact. This helps your team identify critical weaknesses first and allocate resources to the security issues that require the most attention.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="deliver__item rv">
          {{ icon("wrench") }}
          <div>
            <h3 class="deliver__title">Actionable Remediation Recommendations</h3>
            <p class="deliver__text">We provide practical guidance to help address network security gaps through improved firewall settings and access controls along with configuration updates and other relevant security measures.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="deliver__item rv">
          {{ icon("route") }}
          <div>
            <h3 class="deliver__title">Network Exposure and Attack Path Insights</h3>
            <p class="deliver__text">Understand how identified weaknesses could create entry points into your network or expose connected systems to unauthorized access. These insights help your team identify areas where additional protection or tighter access restrictions may be needed.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="deliver__item rv">
          {{ icon("chat") }}
          <div>
            <h3 class="deliver__title">Security Review and Findings Discussion</h3>
            <p class="deliver__text">A review session can help your team understand the assessment results and clarify important findings. This supports informed remediation planning and helps technical stakeholders prioritize improvements based on risk.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="deliver__item rv">
          {{ icon("shield-check") }}
          <div>
            <h3 class="deliver__title">Retesting and Verification Report</h3>
            <p class="deliver__text">After remediation, retesting can verify the status of reported vulnerabilities and document the results. This helps confirm that corrective actions have addressed identified weaknesses and highlights any remaining security concerns.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

